  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98882e993ec69eb4381731d17a1de6ef, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 3
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Gimana, betah kan di sini?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 90c57a6c2596e884ca55b90a272f29fc, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Betah. Oh iya, tadi ada kejadian. Ada orang yang sengaja bikin Wi-Fi palsu
      di dalam kafe.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 04a4f4f168a5c384abfa52a715d1aef0, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a762c1641c16444a95ac89da63ccb77, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 2
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Serius?! Sudah ditangani?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d8d05f2882cf3d14c9eaa8ad2bb8c2ee, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Sudah. Tapi ke depannya, mungkin kafe bisa pasang pengumuman nama Wi-Fi
      resmi di pintu masuk, biar tamu nggak salah connect.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b904cc24f8837a41b36149c77b3953d, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9ac2e8d601eebc54cb32b5596936edbf, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 3
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Wah, ide bagus! Terima kasih ya sudah bantu kami.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cafb19af0cab1a14091ec6ab11e55f24, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Sama-sama. Jaga keamanan jaringannya ya.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b2f90e080d3b3ac43b879d229b22e595, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6eefd0a9f5867fc429d6c495a0f3991a, type: 3}
  hasChoice: 0
  acceptText: Ya
  rejectText: Tidak
